message: "If you use this course or its code in teaching, research or a derived work, please cite it as below. The MIT licence in this file applies only to original source code; educational content is CC BY 4.0 and original synthetic datasets are CC0 1.0."
title: "Artificial Intelligence — A Comprehensive Course"
abstract: >-
  A university-level, self-study course in artificial intelligence: fourteen modules covering
  search, knowledge representation and reasoning, uncertainty, machine learning, neural
  networks, NLP, computer vision, reinforcement learning, generative models, agents, responsible
  and secure AI, and applied systems, with guided laboratories, runnable notebooks, assessments
  and a capstone project. Original source code is MIT-licensed, educational content is CC BY 4.0,
  and original synthetic datasets are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.
type: software
license: MIT
